{"chunk_id": "a913a57124d4", "text": "After heavy Rakshasa losses, the survivors report to Ravana that many of his champions\u2014including Devantaka, Trishiras, and Atikaya\u2014have been slain. Ravana sinks into grief, but his formidable son Indrajita vows to avenge them and destroy Rama and Lakshmana. He departs in a magnificent war chariot accompanied by monstrous Rakshasa forces mounted on strange beasts. Before battle he performs a dark sacrificial rite to the fire god, invoking cosmic powers and the Brahma weapon. Empowered by the ritual, Indrajita becomes invisible in the sky. From this unseen vantage he unleashes a devastating storm of enchanted arrows on the monkey army, striking down their greatest leaders and spreading panic across the battlefield. Even Rama recognizes the divine power behind Indrajita\u2019s invisibility and prepares to endure the assault, allowing the demon prince to believe he has achieved victory.\nIndrajit performs rituals, becomes invisible using divine power, and devastates the monkey army with a rain of arrows, wounding many leaders including Rama and Lakshmana.\nThemes: sorcery in warfare, divine weapons, battlefield devastation, demonic ritual, heroic endurance", "vector": [0.0015114692505449057, -0.015242855995893478, -0.0070609282702207565, 0.01498311199247837, 0.007867501117289066, 0.018851926550269127, -0.03157936781644821, -0.04068407043814659, -0.008721920661628246, -0.01027354784309864, 0.015119818970561028, 0.014340587891638279, 0.014805392362177372, -0.006059547886252403, 0.001024449709802866, 0.02535919100046158, 0.039945852011442184, -0.01719776913523674, 0.02991154044866562, 0.003154519246891141, -0.007354848552495241, 0.0003748768358491361, -0.0006497865542769432, 0.019508121535182, -0.022378971800208092, -0.0029426231049001217, 0.013349460437893867, -0.03256366029381752, 0.005827145650982857, -0.007600921671837568, -6.680497608613223e-05, -0.013226424343883991, -0.0027614859864115715, -0.005027408245950937, -0.028